@startuml uc_002_compilation
!include common/uc_styles.puml

title **UC-002 — Compilation**\n(Bounded Context: Compilation · C4: compilation)

left to right direction

actor "Regulatory\nOfficial" as RO #E3F2FD
actor "Optional\nCompile Client" as OPT #E8F5E9

rectangle "Selma Application" as SYS {
  rectangle "Compilation\n(compilation)" as BOUNDED {

    usecase "Trigger Compilation"             as UC1
    usecase "Validate Rule Schema"            as UC2
    usecase "Detect Strategy Discriminator"   as UC3
    usecase "Validate Complexity"             as UC4
    usecase "Validate Portability"            as UC5
    usecase "Materialize CG-IR"              as UC6
    usecase "Publish Snapshot"                as UC7
    usecase "Reuse Incremental"              as UC8
  }
}

' ---- associations ----
RO --> UC1 : via directive change\n(api → compilation)
OPT --> UC1 : optional client\n(not a C4 peer)

UC1 ..> UC2 : <<include>>
UC1 ..> UC3 : <<include>>
UC1 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
UC1 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC2 ..> UC6 : <<include>>
UC3 ..> UC6 : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC6 : <<include>>
UC5 ..> UC6 : <<include>>
UC6 ..> UC7 : <<include>>

UC8 ..> UC6 : <<extend>>

' ---- notes ----
note right of UC1
  **Pre:** Executable documents in Directives;
  directive change or explicit compile request
  **Post:** Compilation pipeline initiated
  **C4:** compilation reads via directives_repository;
  publishes via compiled_rules_repository
end note

note right of UC6
  **Pre:** All validations pass
  **Post:** CG-IR snapshot produced
end note

note bottom of UC7
  **Pre:** CG-IR materialized
  **Post:** Snapshot published to compiled_rules (CAS)
end note

@enduml
